Error [E0112]: Secret-bearing `Secret` cannot use `:Debug`
  --> tests/ui/crypto_secret_debug.jet:6:13
    |
  6 |     print("{secret:Debug}")
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: Debug output could copy cryptographic secret material into logs or diagnostics
 Fix: Remove the interpolation; log a public operation label or key identifier instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
